dict(slug="causa-limena-receta", cat="latam", fecha="2026-10-29",
 img="https://images.pexels.com/photos/28448382/pexels-photo-28448382/free-photo-of-colorful-peruvian-causa-rellena-dish-close-up.jpeg", foto="Pexels",
 es=dict(
  titulo="Causa limeña: la torre de papa amarilla y ají que se arma en un aro",
  bajada="De la clase de Perú de Cocina Latinoamericana: puré de papa con ají amarillo y limón, relleno de pollo y un armado en capas que no se desarma.",
  cuerpo=[
   ("p","La causa limeña es un plato frío peruano: un puré de papa amarilla sazonado con ají amarillo, limón y aceite, que se arma en capas con un relleno. En la escuela la hicimos con pollo, pero también se rellena con atún o mariscos."),
   ("h2","Ingredientes"),
   ("tabla",["Ingrediente","Cantidad"],[
     ["Papas amarillas","4"],
     ["Ají amarillo","1/2"],
     ["Limón","1/2 (el jugo)"],
     ["Aceite","50 cc"],
     ["Pechuga de pollo","1"],
     ["Mayonesa","La necesaria"],
     ["Tomate","1"],
     ["Palta","1"],
     ["Huevo","1"],
     ["Sal y pimienta","A gusto"],
   ]),
   ("h2","Paso a paso"),
   ("ol",["Hervé la pechuga de 15 a 20 minutos, enfriala y desmechala.","Cociná las papas con piel en abundante agua con sal hasta que estén blandas y hacé un puré.","Cociná el huevo 10 minutos, enfrialo y reservalo.","Cortá el tomate en concassé (pelado, sin semillas y en cubos).","Limpiá el ají amarillo, cortalo y licualo.","Mezclá el puré con el ají licuado hasta que quede parejo. Sumá el jugo de limón y un poco de aceite.","Mezclá el pollo con el tomate y la mayonesa hasta lograr un relleno compacto. Salpimentá."]),
   ("h2","El armado"),
   ("ol",["En un aro de 8 a 10 cm, poné una capa de papa con ají.","Encima, una capa del relleno de pollo.","Repetí hasta formar una torre.","Terminá con láminas finas de palta y cuartos de huevo duro, y desmoldá con cuidado."]),
   ("tip","El relleno tiene que ser compacto, con la mayonesa justa: si queda húmedo, la torre se desliza al desmoldar."),
   ("dato","Es un plato ideal para recibir: se arma antes y se sirve frío. Y con ceviche y lomo saltado es parte de la clase de Perú; mirá <a href=\"/blog/ceviche-peruano-receta-y-secretos\">el ceviche peruano</a>."),
  ]),
 en=dict(
  titulo="Causa limeña: the yellow potato and ají tower built in a ring",
  bajada="From the Peru class of Latin American Cooking: potato purée with ají amarillo and lime, a chicken filling and layers that hold together.",
  cuerpo=[
   ("p","Causa limeña is a cold Peruvian dish: a yellow potato purée seasoned with ají amarillo, lime and oil, layered with a filling. At school we made it with chicken, but it's also filled with tuna or seafood."),
   ("h2","Ingredients"),
   ("tabla",["Ingredient","Amount"],[
     ["Yellow potatoes","4"],
     ["Ají amarillo (Peruvian yellow chili)","1/2"],
     ["Lime or lemon","1/2 (the juice)"],
     ["Oil","50 ml"],
     ["Chicken breast","1"],
     ["Mayonnaise","As needed"],
     ["Tomato","1"],
     ["Avocado","1"],
     ["Egg","1"],
     ["Salt and pepper","To taste"],
   ]),
   ("h2","Step by step"),
   ("ol",["Boil the chicken breast for 15 to 20 minutes, cool and shred it.","Cook the potatoes in their skins in plenty of salted water until soft, then mash.","Cook the egg for 10 minutes, cool and set aside.","Cut the tomato into concassé (peeled, seeded and diced).","Clean the ají amarillo, chop and blend it.","Mix the purée with the blended ají until even. Add the lime juice and a little oil.","Mix the chicken with the tomato and mayonnaise into a compact filling. Season."]),
   ("h2","Assembly"),
   ("ol",["In an 8–10 cm ring, add a layer of the ají potato.","On top, a layer of the chicken filling.","Repeat to build a tower.","Finish with thin slices of avocado and quarters of hard-boiled egg, and unmold carefully."]),
   ("tip","The filling must be compact, with just enough mayo: if it's wet, the tower slides when you unmold it."),
   ("dato","It's perfect for entertaining: build it ahead and serve it cold. Along with ceviche and lomo saltado it's part of the Peru class; see <a href=\"/blog/ceviche-peruano-receta-y-secretos\">Peruvian ceviche</a>."),
  ])),
