dict(slug="feijoada-con-farofa", cat="latam", fecha="2026-10-29",
 img="https://images.pexels.com/photos/34234277/pexels-photo-34234277/free-photo-of-traditional-brazilian-feijoada-with-sides.png", foto="Pexels",
 es=dict(
  titulo="Feijoada con farofa y arroz brasileño: el plato de la clase de Brasil",
  bajada="Porotos negros con cerdo, panceta y embutidos hasta quedar untuoso, la farofa de mandioca tostada con cebolla y el arroz blanco que los acompaña.",
  cuerpo=[
   ("p","La feijoada es el guiso nacional de Brasil: porotos negros cocinados con distintos cortes de cerdo y embutidos. En la escuela la acompañamos como se sirve allá: con farofa, arroz blanco y naranja."),
   ("h2","Ingredientes de la feijoada"),
   ("tabla",["Ingrediente","Cantidad"],[
     ["Bola de lomo de cerdo","500 g"],
     ["Pierna de cerdo en rodajas","300 g"],
     ["Patita de cerdo","1"],
     ["Panceta entera","150 g"],
     ["Salchicha parrillera","150 g"],
     ["Chorizo colorado","100 g"],
     ["Porotos negros","300 g"],
     ["Cebollas medianas y ajo","2 cebollas, 4 dientes"],
     ["Tomate y naranja","1 de cada uno"],
     ["Aceite de girasol","100 ml"],
     ["Agua","Unos 2 litros, según la olla"],
     ["Pimienta negra en grano y sal","10 g de pimienta"],
   ]),
   ("h2","Paso a paso"),
   ("ol",["Cortá la bola de lomo y la pierna en cubos de 3 cm, condimentalos con sal y pimienta en grano y dejalos 30 minutos.","Blanqueá la patita en agua hirviendo con sal.","Sacale el cuero a la panceta y cortala en lardones de 2 cm. Cortá la salchicha en trozos de 3 cm y el chorizo colorado, pelado, en cuartos de rodaja.","Cortá la cebolla y el ajo en brunoise, el tomate en concassé y la naranja pelada, sin la parte blanca ni semillas, en trozos.","Rehogá la cebolla y el ajo en aceite hasta que estén transparentes.","Sumá la panceta, el chorizo y la salchicha y cociná 5 minutos a fuego medio.","Subí el fuego y sellá los cubos de carne (sin los granos de pimienta).","Agregá la naranja, el tomate, los porotos y el agua.","Cociná tapado a fuego suave de 40 a 50 minutos, hasta que la carne esté tierna y los porotos cremosos.","Destapá, cociná 5 minutos más y rectificá la sal y la pimienta."]),
   ("tip","El punto: un guiso untuoso, con los porotos cremosos por dentro pero enteros. Si se desarman, se pasó de cocción."),
   ("h2","La farofa"),
   ("p","1 cebolla grande en emincé, 20 cc de aceite de oliva, 30 g de manteca y 240 g de harina de mandioca. Se carameliza la cebolla en el aceite y la manteca, se suma la harina, se condimenta y se tuesta unos minutos, revolviendo, hasta que esté crocante."),
   ("h2","El arroz blanco brasileño"),
   ("p","150 g de arroz, 1/2 cebolla y 1 diente de ajo picados, 60 cc de aceite, 225 cc de agua o caldo y, si querés, media hoja de laurel. Se sofríen la cebolla y el ajo sin dorar, se suma el arroz 1 minuto, después el líquido; se tapa bien y se cocina 22 minutos a fuego medio. Reposo de 5 minutos y sal."),
   ("dato","Como todo guiso, la feijoada mejora de un día para el otro. Se sirve con la farofa por encima, el arroz al costado y gajos de naranja."),
  ]),
 en=dict(
  titulo="Feijoada with farofa and Brazilian rice: the dish from the Brazil class",
  bajada="Black beans with pork, bacon and sausages cooked until rich, toasted cassava farofa with onion, and the white rice that goes with them.",
  cuerpo=[
   ("p","Feijoada is Brazil's national stew: black beans cooked with different pork cuts and sausages. At school we served it the Brazilian way: with farofa, white rice and orange."),
   ("h2","Feijoada ingredients"),
   ("tabla",["Ingredient","Amount"],[
     ["Pork round (bola de lomo)","500 g"],
     ["Sliced pork leg","300 g"],
     ["Pork trotter","1"],
     ["Slab bacon","150 g"],
     ["Fresh grilling sausage","150 g"],
     ["Chorizo colorado (cured)","100 g"],
     ["Black beans","300 g"],
     ["Medium onions and garlic","2 onions, 4 cloves"],
     ["Tomato and orange","1 of each"],
     ["Sunflower oil","100 ml"],
     ["Water","About 2 liters, depending on the pot"],
     ["Black peppercorns and salt","10 g peppercorns"],
   ]),
   ("h2","Step by step"),
   ("ol",["Cut the pork round and leg into 3 cm cubes, season with salt and peppercorns and rest 30 minutes.","Blanch the trotter in boiling salted water.","Remove the rind from the bacon and cut it into 2 cm lardons. Cut the sausage into 3 cm pieces and the peeled chorizo into quarter slices.","Finely dice the onion and garlic, cut the tomato into concassé and the peeled orange, without pith or seeds, into chunks.","Sweat the onion and garlic in oil until translucent.","Add the bacon, chorizo and sausage and cook 5 minutes over medium heat.","Turn up the heat and sear the meat cubes (without the peppercorns).","Add the orange, tomato, beans and water.","Cook covered over low heat for 40 to 50 minutes, until the meat is tender and the beans creamy.","Uncover, cook 5 more minutes and adjust salt and pepper."]),
   ("tip","The goal: a rich stew, with beans creamy inside but whole. If they fall apart, it's overcooked."),
   ("h2","Farofa"),
   ("p","1 large onion thinly sliced, 20 ml olive oil, 30 g butter and 240 g cassava flour. Caramelize the onion in the oil and butter, add the flour, season and toast for a few minutes, stirring, until crunchy."),
   ("h2","Brazilian white rice"),
   ("p","150 g rice, 1/2 onion and 1 garlic clove chopped, 60 ml oil, 225 ml water or stock and, if you like, half a bay leaf. Sweat the onion and garlic without browning, add the rice for 1 minute, then the liquid; cover tightly and cook 22 minutes over medium heat. Rest 5 minutes and salt."),
   ("dato","Like any stew, feijoada is better the next day. Serve it with farofa on top, rice on the side and orange wedges."),
  ])),
