dict(slug="pescado-en-papillote-y-beurre-blanc", cat="mar", fecha="2026-10-29",
 img="https://images.pexels.com/photos/37206697/pexels-photo-37206697/free-photo-of-delicious-turkish-grilled-fish-in-clay-dish.jpeg", foto="Pexels",
 es=dict(
  titulo="Pescado en papillote y pesca asada con beurre blanc: dos formas fáciles de la escuela",
  bajada="De la clase de pescados de Cocina 2: el filet que se cocina en su propio vapor dentro de un paquete, y el asado al horno con la salsa de manteca más clásica de Francia.",
  cuerpo=[
   ("p","El pescado se pasa de cocción en segundos. Por eso estas dos técnicas son de las más agradecidas: el papillote lo cocina en su propio vapor, sin que se seque, y el horno con manteca lo resuelve en 6 minutos."),
   ("h2","Pescado en papillote"),
   ("tabla",["Ingrediente","Cantidad"],[
     ["Pescado redondo","1, fileteado, sin espinas ni piel"],
     ["Morrón rojo","1, en juliana fina"],
     ["Cebolla","1, en rodajas"],
     ["Ajo","1 diente, fileteado"],
     ["Tomates cherry","12, a la mitad"],
     ["Aceitunas negras","8, en cuartos"],
     ["Alcaparras","5"],
     ["Albahaca","7 hojas"],
     ["Limón","1, en rodajas muy finas"],
     ["Sal, pimienta, ají molido y aceite de oliva","A gusto"],
     ["Papel manteca","1 metro"],
   ]),
   ("ol",["Freí la mitad del ajo desde aceite frío hasta que tome color café con leche. Reservalo.","Sobre el papel manteca, poné las rodajas de limón y arriba los vegetales con el ajo crudo.","Encima, el filet y los cherrys. Sumá alcaparras, albahaca y aceitunas.","Condimentá y rociá con aceite de oliva.","Cerrá bien el paquete y llevá al horno a 180 °C unos 15 minutos, según el grosor.","Servilo en el mismo paquete y terminá con albahaca fresca y el ajo frito."]),
   ("tip","Abrí el paquete en la mesa: sale todo el vapor aromático de golpe y es parte del plato."),
   ("h2","Pesca asada con beurre blanc"),
   ("p","Un filet de pescado plano, sin piel, sobre una placa con 40 g de manteca en cubos, sal y pimienta: 6 minutos en el horno a 180 °C."),
   ("p","La <strong>beurre blanc</strong> es una emulsión de manteca: 1 echalote en brunoise, 100 cc de vino blanco, 50 cc de vinagre y 50 g de manteca fría."),
   ("ol",["Reducí el vino y el vinagre con la echalote hasta la mitad.","Colá para sacar los sólidos.","Con el líquido caliente, sumá la manteca fría en cubos y batí enérgicamente hasta emulsionar. Salpimentá."]),
   ("tip","La manteca tiene que estar bien fría y entrar de a poco: si la reducción hierve o la manteca se derrite de golpe, la salsa se corta y queda aceitosa."),
   ("h2","El puré duquesa"),
   ("p","La guarnición de la clase: puré de papa frío con una yema, pasado a manga con pico rizado, en formas sobre el plato, que se dora en el horno a 180 °C de 6 a 10 minutos antes de sumar el pescado y la salsa."),
   ("dato","Antes de cocinarlo, mirá <a href=\"/blog/como-elegir-pescado-fresco\">cómo elegir pescado fresco</a>: ojos brillantes, agallas rojas y olor a mar."),
  ]),
 en=dict(
  titulo="Fish en papillote and roast fish with beurre blanc: two easy school methods",
  bajada="From the fish class of Cooking 2: the fillet that steams in its own parcel, and oven-roasted fish with France's classic butter sauce.",
  cuerpo=[
   ("p","Fish overcooks in seconds. That's why these two methods are so forgiving: papillote cooks it in its own steam without drying it out, and the oven with butter does it in 6 minutes."),
   ("h2","Fish en papillote"),
   ("tabla",["Ingredient","Amount"],[
     ["Round fish","1, filleted, boned and skinned"],
     ["Red bell pepper","1, in fine julienne"],
     ["Onion","1, sliced into rings"],
     ["Garlic","1 clove, thinly sliced"],
     ["Cherry tomatoes","12, halved"],
     ["Black olives","8, quartered"],
     ["Capers","5"],
     ["Basil","7 leaves"],
     ["Lemon","1, very thinly sliced"],
     ["Salt, pepper, chili flakes and olive oil","To taste"],
     ["Parchment paper","1 meter"],
   ]),
   ("ol",["Fry half the garlic starting from cold oil until light golden. Set aside.","On the parchment, lay the lemon slices and the vegetables with the raw garlic on top.","Then the fillet and the cherry tomatoes. Add capers, basil and olives.","Season and drizzle with olive oil.","Seal the parcel well and bake at 180 °C for about 15 minutes, depending on thickness.","Serve it in the parcel and finish with fresh basil and the fried garlic."]),
   ("tip","Open the parcel at the table: all the fragrant steam comes out at once, and it's part of the dish."),
   ("h2","Roast fish with beurre blanc"),
   ("p","A skinless flatfish fillet on a tray with 40 g cubed butter, salt and pepper: 6 minutes in the oven at 180 °C."),
   ("p","<strong>Beurre blanc</strong> is a butter emulsion: 1 shallot finely diced, 100 ml white wine, 50 ml vinegar and 50 g cold butter."),
   ("ol",["Reduce the wine and vinegar with the shallot by half.","Strain out the solids.","With the liquid hot, add the cold butter in cubes and whisk vigorously until emulsified. Season."]),
   ("tip","The butter must be very cold and go in gradually: if the reduction boils or the butter melts all at once, the sauce splits and turns greasy."),
   ("h2","Duchess potatoes"),
   ("p","The side from class: cold mashed potato with an egg yolk, piped with a star tip into shapes on the plate and browned in the oven at 180 °C for 6 to 10 minutes before adding the fish and sauce."),
   ("dato","Before you cook it, see <a href=\"/blog/como-elegir-pescado-fresco\">how to choose fresh fish</a>: bright eyes, red gills and a clean sea smell."),
  ])),
